# on Bot1 (17), but that is Bot2's turn and end step, not Bot1's (CR 513.1a). On turn 3 Bot1 has changed nothing this turn - the life it lost
# on turn 2 does not count - so its end step again does nothing, and Bot2 stays at 20 with its hand untouched.

